ns=0, component-findings=0, no advisories), `check_trajectory --strict` clean, all generated artifacts fresh\n- Pre-commit hook passed every gate step (it correctly caught a stale arch-map — new `knowledge_packs` public fn — and a ruff line-join, both fixed)\n\n**Meta repo unaffected:** `docs/knowledge/` is empty (dogfood seeding is WI-155) and the kit's CMP `Knowledge` cells are skill names, so both checks stay dormant. Off-spine change (scripts + tests), so **nothing rides a re-attestation**.\n\n**Handoff:** WI-153 row → `done`; log entry appended; `status.md`/`next-wi` → **WI-154** (research-track process text; docs, phase-default tier); `run-state` **RUNNING**. Not pushed (`docs/push-policy: human`). The unattended loop can continue the research-knowledge campaign from WI-154."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1151,"cache_read_input_tokens":148198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1151},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"77633f82-6762-443a-99e9-f7390f0834de","uuid":"57ec7508-1447-4e29-bcb0-3cff0ff7a8f0","request_id":"req_011Cd3kQZArNvSgRQacak9J9"}
